# Source: https://github.com/vaquerizaslab/chess/issues/32
# Symptom: BEDPE file (two-region interaction format) uses 1-based start
#   coordinates (start=1) instead of required 0-based; arises from Hi-C
#   analysis tools that emit BEDPE with 1-based coordinates from 1-indexed
#   internal data structures.  A parser expecting 0-based half-open intervals
#   will compute pair lengths off by one.
#   Note: BEDPE is an extension of BED (6 required fields per region pair);
#   the 0-based coordinate requirement applies to both halves.
chr1	1	10000001	chr1	1	10000001	pair001	0	+	+
chr9	21900001	31900001	chr9	21900001	31900001	pair002	0	+	-
